        <mxCell id="2Bc5S3B-lTE_gWZhwM-D-66" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontColor=#808080;" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;transcript use a reducer append&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;case_performance is written based on the rubric (RAG or embedded by prompt)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;candidate_profile and case_prompt are injected with invoke() in the first node, retrieved by an scenario JSON&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;enough_evidence is written by True by the Interviewer when it thinks that there is enough evidence to evaluate the response but the judge agent can revert it to False and add info in the focus area&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;focus_area is written by the judge, and read by the inerviewr&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
